00:07:13,333 --> 00:07:19,333
Was Shakespeare a Fraud?

2
00:14:26,666 --> 00:14:32,666
Anonymous is a drama, history, thriller film directed by Roland Emmerich.

3
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:46,000
Set against the backdrop of the succession of Queen Elizabeth I, and the Essex Rebellion against her, the story
advances the theory that it was in fact Edward De Vere, Earl of Oxford who penned Shakespeare's plays.

